"An AI assistant is the persona that answers Live Chat visitors; it uses an AI connection (a LiteLLM\n"
"                server or an n8n webhook). Tick \"Available in Live Chat\" so Live Chat managers can choose it for\n"
"                their channels."
msgstr ""
"AI 助理是回答線上客服訪客的角色，它使用一個 AI 連線（LiteLLM 伺服器或 n8n webhook）。勾選「可用在 Live "
"Chat」後，線上客服管理員才能為頻道選用它。"

