#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:im_livechat_ai.selection__im_livechat_ai_connection__backend_type__openai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:im_livechat_ai.selection__llm_api_log__backend_type__openai
msgid "LiteLLM (OpenAI compatible)"
msgstr "LiteLLM（OpenAI 相容）"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_ai_connection__api_key
msgid ""
"LiteLLM (required): sent as \"Authorization: Bearer\" (a LiteLLM virtual "
"key: rate limits are set there). n8n (optional): the signing secret of the "
"X-Woow-Signature HMAC (never sent); without one requests are not signed, "
"e.g. for a public n8n Chat Trigger. Leave empty to keep the current key; the"
" saved key is never shown again. Changing the endpoint host or the backend "
"type removes the saved key, so it is never sent to another server: enter it "
"again."
msgstr ""
"LiteLLM（必填）：以「Authorization: Bearer」送出（LiteLLM "
"虛擬金鑰：速率限制設在那裡）。n8n（選填）：X-Woow-Signature HMAC 的簽章金鑰（不會送出）；不填則請求不簽章，例如公開的 n8n "
"Chat Trigger。留空則保留目前的金鑰；已儲存的金鑰不會再顯示。變更後端主機或後端類型會移除已儲存的金鑰，讓它不會被送到別的伺服器：請重新輸入。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_ai_connection__customer_safe
msgid ""
"LiteLLM connections are chat-only (Odoo sends the conversation, never "
"tools): always safe. n8n: tick it only after checking that the workflow "
"looks up no company data, calls no tools and keeps no memory across "
"conversations; it is cleared when the endpoint URL or the backend type "
"changes. Live Chat visitors are mostly anonymous customers: a channel whose "
"AI assistant uses a connection that is not safe shows a warning."
msgstr ""
"LiteLLM 連線只用來聊天（Odoo "
"只送對話，從不送工具）：一律可給客戶使用。n8n：確認工作流程不查公司資料、不呼叫工具、也不跨對話保留記憶後才勾選；變更後端網址或後端類型時會自動取消勾選。線上客服的訪客大多是匿名客戶：頻道的"
" AI 助理若使用未標示可給客戶使用的連線，會顯示警告。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:im_livechat_ai.view_im_livechat_ai_connection_form
msgid ""
"LiteLLM connections are chat-only: Odoo sends the conversation and never any tool,\n"
"                                so they are always safe for customers."
msgstr "LiteLLM 連線只用來聊天：Odoo 只送對話、從不送任何工具，所以一律可給客戶使用。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/im_livechat_ai/models/ai_connection.py:0
msgid "LiteLLM connections are chat-only: they are always safe for customers."
msgstr "LiteLLM 連線只用來聊天：一律可給客戶使用。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_ai_connection__model
msgid ""
"LiteLLM only (required): the LiteLLM model name, which picks the deployment."
" A LiteLLM connection without one is not ready and fails Test Connection."
msgstr "僅 LiteLLM（必填）：LiteLLM 的模型名稱，用來選擇部署。沒有模型的 LiteLLM 連線未就緒，測試連線也不會通過。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_ai_connection__document_mode
msgid ""
"LiteLLM only: how the documents visitors send (PDF, docx, xlsx, xls, csv, "
"txt, md, json) reach the model. \"Send the files\": each document of at most"
" 4 MB is sent as it is, as a file part (LiteLLM reads PDF, Word and Excel "
"files); Odoo converts nothing. \"Download links only\": a signed 1-hour link"
" instead, for a server that refuses file parts. Images are always sent "
"inline. n8n always gets download links."
msgstr ""
"僅 LiteLLM：訪客傳送的文件（PDF、docx、xlsx、xls、csv、txt、md、json）如何送給模型。「把檔案送給模型」：每份 4 MB"
" 以內的文件以檔案部分原樣送出（LiteLLM 會讀 PDF、Word 與 Excel 檔）；Odoo 不做任何轉換。「只給下載連結」：改給 1 "
"小時有效的簽章連結，給不接受檔案部分的伺服器使用。圖片一律直接內嵌送出。n8n 一律收到下載連結。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_ai_connection__backend_type
msgid ""
"LiteLLM: Odoo sends the conversation to /v1/chat/completions and posts the "
"answer; it never sends tools, so the connection is chat-only. n8n: Odoo "
"sends the conversation to a webhook; what the workflow does (data lookups, "
"tools, memory) is up to the workflow."
