#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_channel__ai_handoff_keywords
msgid ""
"Optional, empty by default: the AI backend decides when the visitor wants a "
"human (it ends its reply with [[handoff]], n8n answers \"handoff\": true). "
"Comma-separated words or phrases checked before the backend is called: when "
"a visitor message contains one of them, the AI sends the handoff message at "
"once without calling the backend, waits for an operator and notifies the "
"operators. Chinese entries match anywhere in the message; English entries "
"match whole words or phrases only, case-insensitive. Example: 找真人,轉人工,talk "
"to a human."
msgstr ""
"選填，預設空白：由 AI 後端判斷訪客是否要找真人（回覆最後寫 [[handoff]]，n8n 回 \"handoff\": "
"true）。這裡以逗號分隔的字詞或片語會在呼叫後端之前先檢查：訪客訊息含其中之一時，AI "
"不呼叫後端、直接回一次轉接訊息、通知客服並等候客服接手。中文關鍵字出現在訊息任何位置都算；英文字詞要整個字或整個片語相符，不分大小寫。例如：找真人,轉人工,talk"
" to a human。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:im_livechat_ai.view_im_livechat_ai_connection_form
