msgstr "選填。留空則由後端決定角色。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:im_livechat_ai.view_im_livechat_ai_connection_form
msgid ""
"Optional. Secret of the X-Woow-Signature HMAC. It is never sent to n8n: "
"verify the signature in the workflow. Without a secret requests are not "
"signed (e.g. a public n8n Chat Trigger). Leave empty to keep the current "
"secret; use Remove API Key to stop signing. Changing the endpoint host or "
"the backend type removes it."
msgstr ""
"選填。X-Woow-Signature HMAC 的簽章金鑰，不會送給 n8n：請在工作流程中驗證簽章。沒有簽章金鑰時請求不簽章（例如公開的 n8n "
"Chat Trigger）。留空則保留目前的簽章金鑰；按「移除 API 金鑰」停止簽章。變更後端主機或後端類型會移除它。"

