"Replies are processed in a background thread of the web worker that received"
" the visitor message; the scheduled action \"Live Chat AI: Recover Reply "
"Jobs\" (every 2 minutes) sends the replies left behind by a restart or a "
"deploy, and the replies due after an unanswered handoff wait. A cron process"
" must be running."
msgstr ""
"回覆在收到訪客訊息的 Web worker 的背景執行緒中處理；排程動作「線上客服 AI：補救未完成的回覆工作」（每 2 "
"分鐘）會補送因重新啟動或部署而遺留的回覆，以及等候真人無人回覆後該送的回覆。必須有 cron 程序在執行。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:im_livechat_ai.action_im_livechat_ai_usage_month
msgid ""
"Replies of the Live Chat AI assistants per month (UTC) and channel: a reference for invoicing by\n"
"                hand, never a limit (limits live in the LiteLLM keys). Counted from the upgrade to 18.0.2.0.0 on; kept\n"
"                permanently; the call logs are kept 30 days."
