msgstr "送給後端的請求內容（JSON，不含金鑰）。只有在 AI 連線開啟「記錄請求內容」時才會儲存。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/im_livechat_ai/models/ai_assistant.py:0
msgid ""
"The scheduled action \"Live Chat AI: Recover Reply Jobs\" has not run for "
"more than %(minutes)s minutes. Check that the Odoo cron process "
"(max_cron_threads of at least 1) is running: the replies after a restart or "
"a deploy and the replies after a handoff wait depend on it."
msgstr ""
"排程動作「線上客服 AI：補救未完成的回覆工作」已超過 %(minutes)s 分鐘沒有執行。請確認 Odoo 的 cron "
"程序有在執行（max_cron_threads 至少 1）：重新啟動或部署後的回覆，以及等候真人後的回覆都靠它。"

