msgstr "這個回覆工作的失敗已提醒客服人員；這個頻道同一種失敗 10 分鐘內不會再提醒。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_ai_connection__timeout_seconds
msgid ""
"Time for one answer, retries included (10-300 seconds). Each call waits at "
"most the time left for the backend, after at most 10 seconds to connect; a "
"backend that keeps sending bytes slowly can take longer. New connections: 45"
" seconds for LiteLLM, 120 seconds for n8n. Live Chat replies are not "
"streamed: the visitor gets the whole answer, or the error message when the "
"time is up. A timed-out call is never retried."
msgstr ""
"一次回答的時間，包含重試（10-300 秒）。每次呼叫連線最多 10 "
"秒，之後最多等候剩下的時間；後端若一直緩慢地送出資料，可能會更久。新連線：LiteLLM 45 秒、n8n 120 "
"秒。線上客服的回覆不串流：訪客收到完整回答，時間到則收到錯誤訊息。逾時的呼叫一律不重試。"

