#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:im_livechat_ai.im_livechat_channel_view_form_inherit_ai
msgid ""
"When an operator posts in a conversation, the AI stays silent for the pause\n"
"                            minutes (every operator message extends it). When the visitor asks for a human\n"
"                            (the AI backend decides, or one of the keywords), the visitor gets the handoff\n"
"                            message, the operators are notified and the AI waits for an operator; the first\n"
"                            visitor message during the wait gets the waiting notice once. If no operator\n"
"                            replies before the wait ends, the AI answers the messages the visitor wrote\n"
"                            meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"客服人員在對話中發言後，AI 會在暫停分鐘數內不出聲（客服每次發言都會再延長）。訪客要求真人時（由 AI "
"後端判斷，或符合關鍵字），訪客會收到轉接訊息、客服人員會收到通知，AI "
"會等候客服接手；等候期間訪客的第一則訊息會收到一次等候通知。若等候結束前沒有客服回覆，AI 會回答訪客在等候期間寫的訊息。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_channel__ai_handoff_pause_minutes
